@startuml
hide footbox
actor Pengguna
boundary "Halaman Login"
control "Control Proses Data"
database "Database Pengguna"

Pengguna -> "Halaman Login": Input username & password
"Halaman Login" -> "Control Proses Data": Kirim data login
"Control Proses Data" -> "Database Pengguna": Cek user & password
"Database Pengguna" --> "Control Proses Data": Data user/validasi
"Control Proses Data" -> "Halaman Login": Redirect ke dashboard/role
"Halaman Login" -> Pengguna: Tampilkan hasil (sukses/gagal)
@enduml 